# BGE-M3 K-NRM Evaluation

Status: concluded on 2026-09-07.

## Objective

Evaluate whether BGE-M3 token-level interaction with K-NRM pooling improves held-out resume-JD fit classification over the frozen EmbeddingGemma signed-difference baseline.

## Architecture

For normalized BGE-M3 token matrices `R ∈ ℝⁿˣ¹⁰²⁴` and `J ∈ ℝᵐˣ¹⁰²⁴`, the full cosine-similarity matrix is:

```text
S = JRᵀ ∈ ℝᵐˣⁿ
```

Eleven fixed Gaussian kernels summarize the distribution of all token-pair similarities:

```text
Kₖ = 0.01 Σᵢ log(max(Σⱼ exp(−(Sᵢⱼ − μₖ)² / (2σₖ²)), 10⁻¹⁰))
```

The exact-match kernel uses `μ = 1.0, σ = 0.001`. Ten soft-match kernels use means from `0.9` through `−0.9` in steps of `0.2`, with `σ = 0.1`. The resulting `K ∈ ℝ¹¹` vector is standardized and passed directly through a learned `11 → 3` linear classifier. BGE-M3 and the kernel definitions are frozen. This experiment does not use ColBERT MaxSim.

## Reproduce

```bash { name=materialize-knrm-features }
cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/ml"
.venv/bin/python scripts/materialize_knrm_features.py \
  --token-metadata artifacts/model__bge_m3_multivector_generation.json \
  --device cuda \
  --fold 0
```

```bash { name=train-knrm-fold-zero }
cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/ml"
.venv/bin/python scripts/train_classifier.py \
  --feature-report artifacts/data__bge_m3_knrm_features.json \
  --report artifacts/train__bge_m3_knrm_classifier.json \
  --device cuda \
  --fold 0 \
  --max-epochs 50 \
  --patience 50 \
  --experiment resume-jd-bge-m3-knrm
```

```bash { name=evaluate-knrm-fold-zero }
cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/ml"
.venv/bin/python scripts/evaluate_classifier.py \
  --training-report artifacts/train__bge_m3_knrm_classifier.json \
  --feature-report artifacts/data__bge_m3_knrm_features.json \
  --fold 0 \
  --report artifacts/eval__bge_m3_knrm.json
```

The remaining folds use the same commands and hyperparameters with fold-specific report names:

```bash { name=run-knrm-remaining-folds }
cd "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/ml"
for fold in 1 2; do
  .venv/bin/python scripts/materialize_knrm_features.py \
    --token-metadata artifacts/model__bge_m3_multivector_generation.json \
    --device cuda \
    --fold "$fold" \
    --report "artifacts/data__bge_m3_knrm_features_fold${fold}.json"
  .venv/bin/python scripts/train_classifier.py \
    --feature-report "artifacts/data__bge_m3_knrm_features_fold${fold}.json" \
    --report "artifacts/train__bge_m3_knrm_classifier_fold${fold}.json" \
    --device cuda \
    --fold "$fold" \
    --max-epochs 50 \
    --patience 50 \
    --experiment resume-jd-bge-m3-knrm
  .venv/bin/python scripts/evaluate_classifier.py \
    --training-report "artifacts/train__bge_m3_knrm_classifier_fold${fold}.json" \
    --feature-report "artifacts/data__bge_m3_knrm_features_fold${fold}.json" \
    --fold "$fold" \
    --report "artifacts/eval__bge_m3_knrm_fold${fold}.json"
done
```

