## Three-Fold Outer-Test Comparison

Each EmbeddingGemma comparator uses the same outer fold, inner partition, 50-epoch schedule, class weighting, and validation-loss checkpoint selection as its K-NRM counterpart.

| Fold | Test rows | EmbeddingGemma accuracy | K-NRM accuracy | Delta | EmbeddingGemma macro F1 | K-NRM macro F1 | Delta |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 0 | 10,644 | 0.4785 | 0.6137 | +0.1352 | 0.3787 | 0.4200 | +0.0413 |
| 1 | 10,405 | 0.4422 | 0.5942 | +0.1520 | 0.3711 | 0.4224 | +0.0512 |
| 2 | 10,284 | 0.4473 | 0.5888 | +0.1415 | 0.3902 | 0.4119 | +0.0217 |
| Mean | 10,444 | 0.4560 | 0.5989 | +0.1429 | 0.3800 | 0.4181 | +0.0381 |
| Sample SD | — | 0.0196 | 0.0131 | — | 0.0096 | 0.0055 | — |

Across 31,333 outer-test predictions, the test-row-weighted accuracies are `0.4562` for EmbeddingGemma and `0.5990` for K-NRM. The corresponding test-row-weighted means of the per-fold macro F1 values are `0.3799` and `0.4181`.

K-NRM improves accuracy in every fold by 13.52 to 15.20 percentage points and macro F1 in every fold by 2.17 to 5.12 percentage points.

## Mean Class F1

| Class | EmbeddingGemma | BGE-M3 K-NRM | K-NRM delta |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| No Fit | 0.5980 | 0.7718 | +0.1738 |
| Potential Fit | 0.3080 | 0.2114 | −0.0966 |
| Good Fit | 0.2340 | 0.2710 | +0.0371 |

The aggregate gain is not uniform. K-NRM substantially improves No Fit and modestly improves Good Fit, but it makes Potential Fit materially worse in every-fold mean F1.

## Fold-0 Representation Metrics

| BGE-M3 K-NRM metric | Before training | After training |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| 10-neighbor label purity | 0.6701 | 0.6402 |
| Silhouette score | 0.0107 | 0.0727 |
| Intra-class cosine similarity | 0.0344 | 0.2779 |
| Inter-class cosine similarity | −0.0351 | 0.0168 |
| Cosine separation | 0.0695 | 0.2611 |
| t-SNE trustworthiness | 0.9995 | 0.9997 |

The learned logits increase silhouette score and cosine separation, while 10-neighbor label purity falls. The t-SNE panels remain visibly label-mixed and were fitted independently, so their absolute layouts are not directly comparable.

